  "title": "Small Business Security: Fighting Very Real Threats with Very Limited Resources",
  "summary": "Mar 06, 2025 - Small organizations face a dangerous mismatch: combating sophisticated cyber threats with minimal resources. This analysis examines six critical security pain points—from single points of failure and default configurations to shadow IT and failed recovery capabilities—that put small businesses at risk despite their IT teams' best efforts.",
